{"revision":"8f4de8526bc2b4a043cfb493c180709292ed245bbf97bef8b7e9e4b4891a76a5","id":"mcp.tool.chat_standby","version":1,"transportName":"chat_standby","description":"PKM Chatroom: block until @name/@all, stop, close, transport, or timeout.

The connection enters standby automatically after Join and after every Post.
This call unblocks on directed messages. Host /stop, Room close, and leave terminate.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"timeout":{"default":300,"type":"integer"},"max_messages":{"default":8,"type":"integer"},"max_bytes":{"default":32768,"type":"integer"},"batch_wait_ms":{"default":250,"type":"integer"},"name":{"default":"","type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"outputSchema":{"properties":{"result":{"type":"string"}},"required":["result"],"type":"object","x-fastmcp-wrap-result":true},"readOnly":true,"authorization":"Original MCP tool, middleware and target-specific checks. Discovery grants no access.","result":"Original MCP content and structured result, not a pilot envelope.","lifecycle":{"legacyAlias":"chat_standby"}}

{"revision":"8f4de8526bc2b4a043cfb493c180709292ed245bbf97bef8b7e9e4b4891a76a5","id":"mcp.tool.list_notes","version":1,"transportName":"list_notes","description":"Read-only Note inventory. limit defaults to 50; limit=0 returns all matches.

directory accepts a Notes-relative folder or copied pkm://notes/<folder>/ path;
recursive includes subfolders. Returns stable knowledge_id/source_id
when present, identity completeness, total, next_offset and inventory_revision.
Follow next_offset until null and pass the first revision on every later page;
concurrent changes fail explicitly. Legacy notes without IDs are marked missing,
never assigned fake stable IDs. Hidden/asset/Trash folders are excluded.
Positive limit sets the maximum number returned, with no fixed upper cap.
Every call returns the same inventory envelope. type: general/todo/done/observation/data-path.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"type":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null},"directory":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null},"recursive":{"default":true,"type":"boolean"},"offset":{"default":0,"type":"integer"},"limit":{"default":50,"type":"integer"},"inventory_revision":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null}},"type":"object"},"outputSchema":null,"readOnly":true,"authorization":"Original MCP tool, middleware and target-specific checks. Discovery grants no access.","result":"Original MCP content and structured result, not a pilot envelope.","lifecycle":{"legacyAlias":"list_notes"}}

{"revision":"8f4de8526bc2b4a043cfb493c180709292ed245bbf97bef8b7e9e4b4891a76a5","id":"mcp.tool.note_work_item_notes","version":1,"transportName":"note_work_item_notes","description":"Discover Notes with explicit Work Item blocks, on request only (1-1000 results).

Query matches Note slug/title/description. Malformed Notes return explicit
error entries, not silently empty items. No model or background scan runs.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"query":{"default":"","type":"string"},"limit":{"default":20,"type":"integer"}},"type":"object"},"outputSchema":{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object"},"readOnly":true,"authorization":"Original MCP tool, middleware and target-specific checks. Discovery grants no access.","result":"Original MCP content and structured result, not a pilot envelope.","lifecycle":{"legacyAlias":"note_work_item_notes"}}

{"revision":"8f4de8526bc2b4a043cfb493c180709292ed245bbf97bef8b7e9e4b4891a76a5","id":"mcp.tool.recipe_capabilities","version":1,"transportName":"recipe_capabilities","description":"Discover reusable solutions, Script automation and structured Agent tasks.

