Human gates and Agent/native/subflow nodes remain explicit boundaries.
The default preserves lazy execution. Compact output omits historical results.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"recipe_id":{"type":"string"},"command_id":{"type":"string"},"inputs_json":{"default":"{}","type":"string"},"project_id":{"default":"","type":"string"},"expected_revision":{"default":0,"type":"integer"},"expected_digest":{"default":"","type":"string"},"detail":{"default":"compact","type":"string"},"autonomous":{"default":false,"type":"boolean"},"max_auto_nodes":{"default":100,"type":"integer"},"max_auto_seconds":{"default":300,"type":"integer"}},"required":["recipe_id","command_id"],"type":"object"},"outputSchema":null,"readOnly":false,"authorization":"Original MCP tool, middleware and target-specific checks. Discovery grants no access.","result":"Original MCP content and structured result, not a pilot envelope.","lifecycle":{"legacyAlias":"recipe_run_start"}}

{"revision":"8f4de8526bc2b4a043cfb493c180709292ed245bbf97bef8b7e9e4b4891a76a5","id":"mcp.tool.recipe_search","version":1,"transportName":"recipe_search","description":"Find Recipe candidates for a task contract; use proactively even when the user did not mention Recipes.

Qualify candidates by purpose, inputs, outputs, constraints, and graph shape. A no-match
response is valid and returns a design_recipe next action; never force a weak candidate.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"query":{"default":"","type":"string"},"category":{"default":"","type":"string"},"project_id":{"default":"","type":"string"},"limit":{"default":10,"type":"integer"},"task_contract_json":{"default":"{}","type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"outputSchema":null,"readOnly":true,"authorization":"Original MCP tool, middleware and target-specific checks. Discovery grants no access.","result":"Original MCP content and structured result, not a pilot envelope.","lifecycle":{"legacyAlias":"recipe_search"}}

{"revision":"8f4de8526bc2b4a043cfb493c180709292ed245bbf97bef8b7e9e4b4891a76a5","id":"mcp.tool.recipe_usage_summary","version":1,"transportName":"recipe_usage_summary","description":"Aggregate bounded Recipe usage by Recipe identity and revision.

Child subflows are independent runs and are counted only under their own Recipe.
Measured provider tokens, caller estimates, and protocol payload estimates remain separate.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"recipe_id":{"default":"","type":"string"},"limit":{"default":50,"type":"integer"}},"type":"object"},"outputSchema":null,"readOnly":true,"authorization":"Original MCP tool, middleware and target-specific checks. Discovery grants no access.","result":"Original MCP content and structured result, not a pilot envelope.","lifecycle":{"legacyAlias":"recipe_usage_summary"}}

