returns the shared envelope. Semantic/dual always return the envelope.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"query":{"type":"string"},"limit":{"default":20,"type":"integer"},"detail":{"default":"legacy","type":"string"},"route":{"default":"lexical","type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"type":"object"},"outputSchema":null,"readOnly":true,"authorization":"Original MCP tool, middleware and target-specific checks. Discovery grants no access.","result":"Original MCP content and structured result, not a pilot envelope.","lifecycle":{"legacyAlias":"search_notes"}}

{"revision":"8f4de8526bc2b4a043cfb493c180709292ed245bbf97bef8b7e9e4b4891a76a5","id":"mcp.tool.todo_board_create","version":1,"transportName":"todo_board_create","description":"Create an empty structured Todo Board in Notes, not a Markdown checklist.

Returns slug, items and digest. Use note_work_item_command to create and
manage tasks; never write task blocks using add_note/update_note.
Named add/update_workitem and add/update_userstory APIs manage contracts;
acceptance delegation remains user-only. Existing documents are never
